WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.533
Chrome already remembers your details for forms. Why should your agent ask you all over again?

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:09.067
Meet Agent Autofill. Autofill, for agents.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:14.967
Your agent can bring in saved names, contact details, and addresses from Chrome, ready for your review.

00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:20.533
Then it uses the task's context to choose the relevant details, and asks when something's unclear.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:25.600
Less copying and pasting. Fewer interruptions. Even verification codes from your inbox.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:33.000
Your saved information stays local. You choose what to share. Agent Autofill. Remember once.
